{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fcedab6f-94c5-89c2-b29a-b383f9412799",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T11:02:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kevin Hanlon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:59:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. Almost lunchtime, so make it a good one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T10:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Luis. Yes, well, let me explain. My name is Kevin Hanlon, and I got a parking ticket on my windshield yesterday, and I don't think it's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Hanlon. What was it for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It says expired registration sticker. Now, let me explain. I renewed the registration on Friday, no, Saturday. No, wait. It was the day before the ticket, so that would be Sunday. I did it online, and the sticker hasn't come in the mail yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so you renewed it, but the new sticker's still on its way and the old one's showing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it exactly. So the old one is on the plate, and the new one is, well, in the mail somewhere. Is that the same as an appeal? I got a paper with the ticket, and it says something about contesting, but I don't follow which box I check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the appeal. You check the box for contesting, and send it in with a copy of your renewal receipt. That's what they'll want to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:00:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A receipt. I have that, it's printed. How long does an appeal take, once it's sent?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks is typical. Could be a bit more if they're backed up. Hold on to your copy of everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. All right. And if I decided to just pay it instead, could I do that on a Saturday? I'm not sure you're open Saturdays. I don't want to be late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall's closed Saturdays, but there's a drop box outside for payments, and you can pay online any time, weekends included. The ticket should have the website on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website. Let me look. Oh, yes, there it is, at the bottom, small print. I'm sorry, I'm at the post office right now, waiting on a package. They're getting it from the back and I'm standing here at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a good time to make calls. Anything else I can sort out before they come back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:01:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. So, appeal with the receipt, or pay online. I'm still not sure which, but I understand the choices. Thank you, Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime, Mr. Hanlon. Hope the package is a good one."
    }
  ],
